  (text "What this does: Gives the flight MCU stable local supplies, its two clock sources, the backup-domain feed,\nthe watchdog-reset memory, the timing strobe and the spare test pads.\nConnects to: FLIGHT_3V3 -> U201 on 02-flight-mcu; FLIGHT_MR_N from the watchdog on 02flight-reset-debug. Main 16 MHz clock and 32.768 kHz RTC clock are separate; their startup margins need measurement."
    (at 15.24 27.94 0.0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.4 1.4))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "a00a6f9e-d2ba-5700-9000-2248e9047fe2")))
